  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.5 — Drop unpublished shipping-carrier and Rumble assembly refs from the packable DLL so client restores can load SocialPosts without Net3000.CanadaPost/FedEx/Purolator/UPS/USPS or net3000.rumble (#7778). Carrier coordinator sources remain in-tree (Compile Remove) for a future companion; RumbleChannelVideoStore lives in host-only ServiceCoordinator.Rumble. AssemblyVersion matches PackageVersion. Depends on net3000.google 1.0.7 (aligned assembly version). 1.0.4 — Add YoutubeConnections entity (an account's own YouTube channel), YouTubeConnectionTokenStore, and the NotConnected / Reconnect messages on YouTubeChannelAssignment; depend on net3000.google 1.0.5 (#3794). 1.0.3 — Add SocialPostSchedules entity (scheduled social posts, #3203). 1.0.2 —Depend on net3000.google 1.0.2 (IGoogleTokenStore). 1.0.1 — Add SocialPosts entity and retarget net10. 1.0.0 — Initial release.",
